{
  "description": "为已观察页面创建同源导航组件。placement=content可插入directory/top/side/progress内容导航；默认placement=global复用或创建整课控制台。presentation选择呈现，位置/当前章节/动作沿同一正式服务，绑定和合法禁用由软件处理。全局层需要整课授权，内容导航只需要页面插入权限。一次事务可撤销，参数可编辑。",
  "inputSchema": {
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "placement": {
        "enum": [
          "global",
          "content"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "presentation": {
        "enum": [
          "console",
          "directory",
          "top",
          "side",
          "progress"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "target": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "target"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  },
  "invocation": "静态目录只说明已登记接口；当前运行是否可调用、文档范围、写权限、短句柄和服务配置，以宿主本轮发现与实际回执为准。",
  "manual": {
    "group": "edit",
    "label": "准备全局控制台",
    "targetKinds": [
      "course-surface"
    ]
  },
  "name": "teacher.ensure",
  "version": 1
}
